# No direct commits to main* branches

Never commit directly to any branch starting with `main` (including `main` and `main-guw`).

Required workflow:

1. Create a feature branch from the default base (`main-guw`)
2. Commit on that feature branch only
3. Push the feature branch to `origin`
4. Open a PR against `guw/deemix` with `--base main-guw`

Also never push commits directly to `main` / `main-guw` / other `main*` branches.
